# PurpleSploit — complete offline dependency set
#
# This is the SUPERSET used to build the offline wheelhouse. It intentionally
# includes optional/guarded dependencies (reporting, OSINT, AI) so the air-gapped
# install has everything, rather than silently degrading at runtime.
#
# Derived from python/setup.py install_requires plus every third-party top-level
# import found in python/purplesploit/ (setup.py was missing requests,
# websockets, packaging, shodan).

